\name{sets}
\alias{sets}
\title{Practical code sets for Time Series Analysis}
\description{
Use \code{set1()} to \code{set6()} to print or run the code of each practical set.
Open the help page of a set (for example \code{?set1}) to read all its code topic-wise.
See \code{\link{ts_index}} for the list of topics.
}
